    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/58d52977c6746bb795160c4877da85b3.avif?t=1755093903\" data-has-big width=800 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell Bug is a fast-paced action roguelike game, but there is a twist, there are no humans in this universe, only HELL BUGS! Before the Big Bug War happened in this earth, none of the bugs had any anomalies but the consequences of war has affected some of them and they evolved into mutant monster bugs, as we call them &quot;HELL BUGS&quot;!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/5cafcd24265c148cc196b4673a127b7b.poster.avif?t=1755093903\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/5cafcd24265c148cc196b4673a127b7b.webm?t=1755093903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/5cafcd24265c148cc196b4673a127b7b.mp4?t=1755093903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some normal bugs tried to survive in their nests, one of them was our brave ant soldier,he did everything he could to keep  his family and nest alive. But he needs equal power to fight with the evil Hell Bugs, so collect eggs from the bosses that you defeat and raise your little Hell Bug army and fight with characters that each have unique abilities!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/0822f9532d7ab8a24c5f4785d5d1aed0.poster.avif?t=1755093903\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/0822f9532d7ab8a24c5f4785d5d1aed0.webm?t=1755093903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/0822f9532d7ab8a24c5f4785d5d1aed0.mp4?t=1755093903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precedural systems like rooms that were hand-crafted and embedded in random system, also with lots of different   weaponry, you can expect to encounter ANYTHING, therefore the fun never ends! You don't die permanently in this universe because of your mutational powers, so don't be sad when you &quot;die&quot;, grab your gun and start again to explore the world of bugs from Hell Bug's perspective!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/58d52977c6746bb795160c4877da85b3.avif?t=1755093903\" data-has-big width=800 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell Bug is a fast-paced action roguelike game, but there is a twist, there are no humans in this universe, only HELL BUGS! Before the Big Bug War happened in this earth, none of the bugs had any anomalies but the consequences of war has affected some of them and they evolved into mutant monster bugs, as we call them &quot;HELL BUGS&quot;!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/5cafcd24265c148cc196b4673a127b7b.poster.avif?t=1755093903\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/5cafcd24265c148cc196b4673a127b7b.webm?t=1755093903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/5cafcd24265c148cc196b4673a127b7b.mp4?t=1755093903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some normal bugs tried to survive in their nests, one of them was our brave ant soldier,he did everything he could to keep  his family and nest alive. But he needs equal power to fight with the evil Hell Bugs, so collect eggs from the bosses that you defeat and raise your little Hell Bug army and fight with characters that each have unique abilities!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/0822f9532d7ab8a24c5f4785d5d1aed0.poster.avif?t=1755093903\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/0822f9532d7ab8a24c5f4785d5d1aed0.webm?t=1755093903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/0822f9532d7ab8a24c5f4785d5d1aed0.mp4?t=1755093903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precedural systems like rooms that were hand-crafted and embedded in random system, also with lots of different   weaponry, you can expect to encounter ANYTHING, therefore the fun never ends! You don't die permanently in this universe because of your mutational powers, so don't be sad when you &quot;die&quot;, grab your gun and start again to explore the world of bugs from Hell Bug's perspective!</p>",
    "short_description": "Crush mutant bugs, unlock new allies from the remains of defeated bosses, and build your own swarm of chaos! Hell Bug is a fast-paced roguelite shooter where every boss you defeat brings you closer to expanding your army with strange and powerful bugs. Each bug has a story, some shouldn't be told.",
